      "Dr. Seward summoned his venerable mentor from Amsterdam, Professor Abraham Van Helsing. Van Helsing recognized the signs of the nosferatu—the Undead. Despite garlic flowers, crucifixes, and four emergency blood transfusions, Lucy succumbed to the vampire's thirst, rising from her tomb as a bloofer lady preying upon innocent children.",
